{"schemaVersion":1,"patchVersion":"26.20","sources":{"ddragon":"16.20.1","cdragon":"16.20"},"locale":"zh_CN","champions":{"Kindred":{"E:横生惧意":{"slot":"E","skill":{"id":"KindredEWrapper","name":"横生惧意","maxrank":5,"cooldown":[14,12.5,11,9.5,8],"cooldownBurn":"14/12.5/11/9.5/8","description":"羊灵进行一发谨慎的定位射击，来使目标减速。如果羊灵又进行了两次攻击，那么她的第三次攻击会指挥狼灵扑向目标，对目标造成巨量伤害。","summary":"羊灵进行一发谨慎的定位射击，来使目标减速。如果羊灵又进行了两次攻击，那么她的第三次攻击会指挥狼灵扑向目标，对目标造成巨量伤害。","tooltip":"千珏弱化一名敌人，对其造成持续1.5秒的(30 + ([[si:scaleap]]5% 法术强度))<span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">减速</span>。<br /><br />千珏在4秒内对目标进行的第三次攻击会引导狼灵扑击该敌人，造成额外<span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(80/110/140/170/200 + ([[si:scalead]]100% 额外攻击力))</span>外加<span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">5.5%已损失生命值的物理伤害</span>。<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">伤害可通过暴击几率和暴击伤害来提升，效能为50%。<br />对野怪的已损失生命值伤害的上限为200。</span>","tooltipSource":"communitydragon","range":[500,500,500,500,500],"rangeBurn":"500/500/500/500/500","image":{"full":"KindredEWrapper.png"},"rankValues":[{"label":"伤害","values":"80/110/140/170/200"},{"label":"冷却时间","values":"14/12.5/11/9.5/8"}],"scalings":[{"id":"damage","labelEn":"E Scaling","labelKo":"E 계수","parts":[{"stat":null,"coefficient":1,"op":"add","rawRef":"2:BaseBiteDamage"}]}],"conditions":[],"simulation":{"status":"expression","expression":{"id":"BaseBiteDamage","kind":"damage","damageType":"physical","root":{"kind":"product","parts":[{"kind":"sum","parts":[{"kind":"value","value":{"byRank":[80,110,140,170,200]}},{"kind":"stat","stat":"bonusAttackDamage","coefficient":{"byRank":[1,1,1,1,1]}}]},{"kind":"sum","parts":[{"kind":"value","value":{"byRank":[1,1,1,1,1]}},{"kind":"product","parts":[{"kind":"stat","stat":"critChance","coefficient":{"byRank":[0.5,0.5,0.5,0.5,0.5]}},{"kind":"sum","parts":[{"kind":"stat","stat":"critDamage","coefficient":{"byRank":[1,1,1,1,1]}},{"kind":"value","value":{"byRank":[-1,-1,-1,-1,-1]}}]}]}]}]},"requiresBuffStacks":false},"unsupportedPartTypes":["BuffCounterByCoefficientCalculationPart","nonlinear-product"]}},"icons":[{"file":"patch-notes/icons/de04751aac54df56e7403f1d72692c0c.webp","spellId":"KindredEWrapper"}]},"W:狼灵狂热":{"slot":"W","skill":{"id":"KindredW","name":"狼灵狂热","maxrank":5,"cooldown":[18,17,16,15,14],"cooldownBurn":"18/17/16/15/14","description":"狼灵狂化并攻击在他附近的敌人。羊灵通过攻击和移动来被动地积攒层数。当层数攒满时，羊灵的下次攻击将治愈生命值。","summary":"狼灵狂化并攻击在他附近的敌人。羊灵通过攻击和移动来被动地积攒层数。当层数攒满时，羊灵的下次攻击将治愈生命值。","tooltip":"<span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-500 italic\">被动：</span>千珏会在移动和攻击时获得层数。在100层时，千珏的下一次攻击会回复至多<span class=\"text-green-600 dark:text-green-400\">(47 ~ 81[[si:scalelevel]])生命值</span>(基于它们的已损失生命值)。<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-900 dark:text-white font-semibold\">主动：</span>千珏划出一块领地，命令狼灵去撕咬被羊灵攻击过的最后一名敌人。狼灵的撕咬造成<span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(25/30/35/40/45 + ([[si:scalead]]20% 额外攻击力) + ([[si:scaleap]]20% 法术强度))</span>外加<span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">2.5%当前生命值的魔法伤害</span>。<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">狼灵会基于千珏的<span>攻击速度</span>而撕咬得更快。对抗野怪时，狼灵造成65%提升伤害和持续2秒的50%<span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">减速</span>。</span>","tooltipSource":"communitydragon","cost":[40,40,40,40,40],"costBurn":"40/40/40/40/40","costType":"法力值","resource":"法力值","range":[560,560,560,560,560],"rangeBurn":"560/560/560/560/560","image":{"full":"KindredW.png"},"rankValues":[{"label":"伤害","values":"25/30/35/40/45"},{"label":"冷却时间","values":"18/17/16/15/14"}],"levelValues":[{"values":[47,49,51,53,55,57,59,61,63,65,67,69,71,73,75,77,79,81,83,85],"digits":0}],"scalings":[{"id":"damage","labelEn":"W Scaling","labelKo":"W 계수","parts":[{"stat":null,"coefficient":1,"op":"add","rawRef":"1:AttackHeal"}]}],"conditions":[],"simulation":{"status":"complete","primary":{"id":"BaseWolfDamage","kind":"damage","damageType":"magical","baseByRank":[25,30,35,40,45],"terms":[{"stat":"bonusAttackDamage","coefficientsByRank"