","values":"15/13.5/12/10.5/9"}],"scalings":[{"id":"damage","labelEn":"W Scaling","labelKo":"W 계수","parts":[{"stat":null,"coefficient":1,"op":"add","rawRef":"1:TotalDamage"}]}],"conditions":[],"simulation":{"status":"complete","primary":{"id":"TotalDamage","kind":"damage","damageType":"magical","baseByRank":[20,32,44,56,68],"terms":[{"stat":"abilityPower","coefficientsByRank":[0.18000000715255737,0.18000000715255737,0.18000000715255737,0.18000000715255737,0.18000000715255737]}]},"unsupportedPartTypes":[]}}}},"Kennen":{"E:奥义！雷铠":{"slot":"E","skill":{"id":"KennenLightningRush","name":"奥义！雷铠","maxrank":5,"cooldown":[10,9,8,7,6],"cooldownBurn":"10/9/8/7/6","description":"凯南变身为一个闪电形态，高速移动并可以穿越单位。对碰到的所有敌人造成伤害并施加一层【忍法！雷缚印】。凯南会在进入这个形态时获得移动速度，并在离开时获得攻击速度。","summary":"凯南变身为一个闪电形态，高速移动并可以穿越单位。对碰到的所有敌人造成伤害并施加一层【忍法！雷缚印】。凯南会在进入这个形态时获得移动速度，并在离开时获得攻击速度。","tooltip":"凯南变成一个闪电球，获得<span class=\"text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-500\">100%移动速度</span>，在穿过敌人时造成<span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(80/120/160/200/240 + ([[si:scaleap]]80% 法术强度))魔法伤害</span>，同时变为幽灵状态，持续2秒。如果凯南对至少一名敌人造成了伤害，那么他会获得40能量。<br /><br />在这个技能结束后，凯南会获得持续4秒的<span>50/60/70/80/90%攻击速度</span>。暴击会将这个时长延长1秒。凯南可以<span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-300\">再次施放</span>以提前结束这个技能。<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">【幽灵】状态的单位能够无视其它单位的碰撞体积。<br />对小兵和野怪造成65%伤害。<br />延长的时长不能超过其初始时长。</span>","tooltipSource":"communitydragon","cost":[80,80,80,80,80],"costBurn":"80/80/80/80/80","costType":"法力值","resource":"法力值","range":[170,170,170,170,170],"rangeBurn":"170/170/170/170/170","image":{"full":"KennenLightningRush.png"},"rankValues":[{"label":"冷却时间","values":"10/9/8/7/6"},{"label":"伤害","values":"80/120/160/200/240"},{"label":"攻击速度","values":"50%/60%/70%/80%/90%"}],"scalings":[{"id":"damage","labelEn":"E Scaling","labelKo":"E 계수","parts":[{"stat":null,"coefficient":1,"op":"add","rawRef":"2:TotalDamage"}]}],"conditions":[],"simulation":{"status":"complete","primary":{"id":"TotalDamage","kind":"damage","damageType":"magical","baseByRank":[80,120,160,200,240],"terms":[{"stat":"abilityPower","coefficientsByRank":[0.800000011920929,0.800000011920929,0.800000011920929,0.800000011920929,0.800000011920929]}]},"unsupportedPartTypes":[]}},"icons":[{"file":"patch-notes/icons/272c0ce3721f673cefcc280525fbf6db.webp","spellId":"KennenLightningRush"}]}},"Lucian":{},"Neeko":{"E:缠结倒刺":{"slot":"E","skill":{"id":"NeekoE","name":"缠结倒刺","maxrank":5,"cooldown":[12,11.5,11,10.5,10],"cooldownBurn":"12/11.5/11/10.5/10","description":"妮蔻投出一团倒刺，对它沿途的所有东西造成伤害和禁锢效果。如果倒刺击杀了一个敌人或穿过了一名英雄，就会变得更大、更快并且禁锢时间更长。","summary":"妮蔻投出一团倒刺，对它沿途的所有东西造成伤害和禁锢效果。如果倒刺击杀了一个敌人或穿过了一名英雄，就会变得更大、更快并且禁锢时间更长。","tooltip":"妮蔻掷出一团倒刺，造成<span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(80/115/150/185/220 + ([[si:scaleap]]65% 法术强度))魔法伤害</span>和0.7/0.9/1.1/1.3/1.5秒的<span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">禁锢</span>效果。<br /><br />倒刺会在命中一名敌方英雄后强化，长得更大、动得更快、并且<span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">禁锢</span>时长变为2/2.25/2.5/2.75/3秒。","tooltipSource":"communitydragon","cost":[60,65,70,75,80],"costBurn":"60/65/70/75/80","costType":"法力值","resource":"法力值","range":[1000,1000,1000,1000,1000],"rangeBurn":"1000/1000/1000/1000/1000","image":{"full":"NeekoE.png"},"rankValues":[{"label":"伤害","values":"80/115/150/185/220"},{"label":"最小禁锢时长","values":"0.7/0.9/1.1/1.3/1.5"},{"label":"强化版禁锢时长","values":"2/2.25/2.5/2.75/3"},{"label":"冷却时间","values":"12/11.5/11/10.5/10"},{"label":"法力值消耗","values":"60/65/70/75/80"}],"scalings":[{"id":"damage","labelEn":"E Scaling","labelKo":"E 계수","parts":[{"stat":null,"coefficient":1,"op":"add","rawRef":"2:BaseDamage"}]}],"conditions":[],"simulation":{"status":"complete","primary":{"id":"BaseDamage","kind":"damage","damageType":"magical","baseByRank":[80,115,150,185,220],"terms":[{"stat":"abilityPower","coefficientsByRank":[0.6499999761581421,0.6499999761581421,0.6499999761581421,0.6499999761581421,0.6499999761581421]}]},"unsupportedPartTypes":[]}}}},"Smolder":{"P:龙之研习":{"slot":"P","passive":{"name":"龙之研习","description":"用技能命中英雄和用<span>超级灼热龙息</span>击杀敌人时会提供一层<span>龙之研习</span>，这些层数可强化斯莫德的各个基础技能。<br /><span><span>超级灼热龙息</span>：造成额外的<span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">0.25魔法伤害</span>并在25层、125层和225层时获得新效果。<span><span>阿嚏！</span>：爆炸造成额外<span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">0.55魔法伤害</span>。<span><span>扑棱，扑棱，扑棱！</span>：每次命中造成额外<span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">0.08魔法伤害</span>并且每100层获得一个额外弹体。","summary":"用技能命中英雄和用超级灼热龙息 击杀敌人时会提供一层龙之研习。层数会提升斯莫德各基础技能的伤害。","spellId":"SmolderP","tooltipSource":"communitydragon","rankValues":[],"scalings":[],"conditions":[],"simulation":{"status":"unavailable","unsupportedPartTypes":[]},"image":{"full":"Icons_Smolder_Passive.png"}}},"R:妈----！":{"slot":"R","skill":{"id":"SmolderR","name":"妈----！","maxrank":3,"cooldown":[120,110,100],"cooldownBurn":"120/110/100","description":"斯莫德召唤他的妈妈从天空喷吐烈焰，对她的烈焰中心的敌人们造成额外伤害和减速。","summary":"斯莫德召唤他的妈妈从天空喷吐烈焰，对她的烈焰中心的敌人们造成额外伤害和减速。","tooltip":"斯莫德的妈妈从天空喷吐烈焰，造成<span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(150/250/350 + ([[si:scalead]]100% 额外攻击力) + ([[si:scaleap]]100% 法术强度))物理伤害</span>。中心的敌人们会转而受到<span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(225/375/525 + ([[si:scalead]]150% 额外攻击力) + ([[si:scaleap]]150% 法术强度))</span>物理伤害和持续2秒的40%<span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">减速</span>。<br /><br />斯莫德的妈妈如果命中了她的儿子，则会为他治疗<span class=\"text-green-600 dark:text-green-400\">(100/175/250 + ([[si:scalead]]75% 额外攻击力) + ([[si:scaleap]]75% 法术强度))生命值</span>。<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">对小兵和野怪造成50%伤害。</span>","tooltipSource":"communitydragon","cost":[100,100,100],"costBurn":"100/100/100","costType":"法力值","resource":"法力值","range":[4200,4200,4200],"rangeBurn":"4200/4200/4200","image":{"full":"SmolderR.png"},"rankValues":[{"label":"伤害","values":"150/250/350"},{"label":"治疗","values":"100/175/250"},{"label":"冷却时间","values":"120/110/100"}],"scalings":[{"id":"damage","labelEn":"R Scaling","labelKo":"R 계수","parts":[{"stat":null,"coefficient":1,"op":"add","rawRef":"3:TotalDamage"}]}],"conditions":[],"simulation":{"status":"complete","primary":{"id":"TotalDamage","kind":"damage","damageType":"physical","baseByRank":[150,250,350],"terms":[{"stat":"bonusAttackDamage","coefficientsByRank":[1,1,1]},{"stat":"abilityPower","coefficientsByRank":[1,1,1]}]},"unsupportedPartTypes":[]}},"icons":[{"file":"patch-notes/icons/7e4ba6d8dbd67832fcbec4d5c4c26cd4.webp","spellId":"SmolderR"}]}},"TahmKench":{"Q:巨舌鞭笞":{"slot":"Q","skill":{"id":"TahmKenchQ","name":"巨舌鞭笞","maxrank":5,"cooldown":[7,6.5,6,5.5,5],"cooldownBurn":"7/6.5/6/5.5/5","description":"塔姆用他的舌头进行猛击，对命中的第一个单位造成伤害和减速效果并在他命中一名敌方英雄时治疗自身。<br><br>对敌方英雄施加一层<spellName>培养品味</spellName>效果。如果目标英雄已经被叠加了3层<spellName>培养品味</spellName>，那么该英雄还会被晕眩，并且层数会被消耗掉。","summary":"塔姆用他的舌头进行猛击，对命中的第一个单位造成伤害和减速效果并在他命中一名敌方英雄时治疗自身。<br><br>对敌方英雄施加一层<spellName>培养品味</spellName>效果。如果目标英雄已经被叠加了3层<spellName>培养品味</spellName>，那么该英雄还会被晕眩，并且层数会被消耗掉。","tooltip":"对命中的第一个敌人造成<span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(75/120/165/210/255 + ([[si:scaleap]]100% 法术强度))魔法伤害</span>和持续2秒的50%<span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">减速</span>。<br /><br />在命中英雄时，塔姆会回复他<span class=\"text-green-600 dark:text-green-400\">10/20/30/40/50 + 他的5/5.5/6/6.5/7%已损失生命值</span>并施加一层<span>培养品味</span>效果并造成<span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">((5 ~ 60[[si:scalelevel]]) + ([[si:scalehealth]]4% 额外生命值) + ([[si:scaleap]]0% 法术强度))额外魔法伤害</span>。如果目标英雄已经被叠加了3层<span>培养品味</span>，那么该英雄还会被<span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">晕眩</span>1.5秒，并且层数会被消耗掉。<br /><br />当你的舌头处在半空中，且命中了远处已经被叠加了3层<span>培养品味</span>的敌方英雄时，激活<span style=\"color: #0bf7de\">大快朵颐</span>即可将其吞噬。<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">巨舌鞭笞的距离会随着塔姆的体型提升。</span>","tooltipSource":"communitydragon","cost":[50,46,42,38,34],"costBurn":"50/46/42/38/34","costType":"法力值","resourc